<title>THAILAND: Bank of Thailand notes average yield 9.81 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Thailand notes average yield 9.81 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand announced on Friday the following result of its weekly notes auction:</p>
<p>   MATURITY  TENDER AMT   ALLOTED AMT    AVG YIELD    RANGE</p>
<p>		 (MLNS BAHT)  (MLNS BAHT)</p>
<p>    28 days    4,070	   2,000	   9.81     8.80-10.98</p>
<p>    2 years    2,200	     500	   9.01     8.50-9.23</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
</text>
